      "text": "arr[j] = 1 < 4 = pivot 不满足while循环判断条件。则：",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "arr[j] = 1 < 4 = pivot 不满足while循环判断条件。则：",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yhINfdv242pJucXUfW25i",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1427.9219271053003,
      "y": 567.9186407788036,
      "width": 177.55194091796875,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
