      "updated": 1767427418226,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "当前i=3, j=5 满足i<j\n① 将arr[i]放在右边的坑\n② j--",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "当前i=3, j=5 满足i<j\n① 将arr[i]放在右边的坑\n② j--",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
