      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769127040261,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如果左半边有剩余(i<=mid)，就把左半边剩余元素拼接到tmp后面。\n否则，就把右半边剩余元素拼接到tmp后面",
      "fontSize": 15.411377842087699,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如果左半边有剩余(i<=mid)，就把左半边剩余元素拼接到tmp后面。\n否则，就把右半边剩余元素拼接到tmp后面",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yqdpG5KqVtljxAZL1tIxY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 267.84271993902166,
