      "text": "假如我们要计算区间[L,R]内所有数的和，那么",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "假如我们要计算区间[L,R]内所有数的和，那么",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qCMzyuAbNKpnOYTqAS9fj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 65.83209482537751,
